  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MF3-02 Engaging Samoan Communities with Science and Technology to foster local technical capability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rotary New Zealand World Community Service (RNZWCS Ltd) will work to establish a Science Discovery Centre and an Outreach Programme to engage teachers and students in STEM based activities, fostering creativity and divergent thinking alongside fundamental disciplines. The Activity will reach communities across Samoa, it will educate primary school children and capacity build teachers with more knowledge, confidence and enthusiasm, thereby further engaging students in science.</narrative>
  </description>
